ets/steam/apps/544790/extras/556a80e868f18403bc49ce63d6ee15fd.poster.avif?t=1607850400\" width=620 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544790/extras/556a80e868f18403bc49ce63d6ee15fd.webm?t=1607850400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544790/extras/556a80e868f18403bc49ce63d6ee15fd.mp4?t=1607850400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Will the princes have to help one another, or will they become enemies? Will they choose a dangerous way and collect the rarest flowers or take a short cut? What bouquet will the Princess get? It’s all up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More About the Game:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Catchy colorful graphics<br></li><li>Charismatic characters!!!<br></li><li>Game as part of a big story with rich storyline<br></li><li>4 amazing worlds to visit<br></li><li>71 challenging achievements<br></li><li>81 unique levels</li></ul><br>This game will touch feeling of both boys and girls. Romance and challenges are intertwined in a single story of the Bouquet for the Princess game. Prove that Princess is worthy of a great and heartwarming feeling! Help princes in their challenging search and struggle for Princess Leya’s heart!",
