                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I normally like games like this, but this one is a mix of broken and too easy. The character cameos pop up and often get stuck on top of the map. Not only do they cover the path and resources that I need to remove, but they also disable overlays for other items + resources so I can't see what I need to clear something or complete a goal. Sometimes restarting a level will fix this issue, other times it reoccurs. \n\nAs for easiness, I generally don't expect it to be too challenging (which is one reason I play), but this is super easy. Even with the bugs holding me up, I still finish well within the time limit.\n\nI would try playing again if the bugs were fixed. But it would be nice if the difficulty was adjusted or had multiple options.",
